  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance Inputs - Supporting the Development of the South Sudan National Police Service (SSNPS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Technical Assistance Inputs - Supporting the Development of the South Sudan National Police Service (SSNPS) is a component of Supporting the Development of the South Sudan National Police Service (SSNPS) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;398,756. It works in the following sector(s): Civilian peace-building, conflict prevention and resolution, Public sector policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
